1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 17=

4
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:16,070
He Xiaoyuan.

5
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,280
Where's the grain transport map?

6
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,480
This...

7
00:01:30,230 --> 00:01:31,200
Is this it?

8
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,280
Which one?

9
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,590
Boqing.

10
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,200
Did you find the map?

11
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,070
I found it.

12
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:06,760
Your Highness.

13
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:08,470
Your hand

14
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:09,470
is still bleeding.

15
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:14,360
Then I'll head back
and have the wound treated.

16
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:14,960
Since

17
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:16,280
the overall plan is settled,

18
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:16,870
I'll leave the rest

19
00:02:17,190 --> 00:02:18,190
to you, Boqing.

20
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:20,030
I'm glad to share
Father's and your burden.

21
00:02:20,590 --> 00:02:21,310
It's no trouble at all.

22
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,000
Have you

23
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,800
remembered anything?

24
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,310
Remembered what?

25
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,520
I mean

26
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,360
what happened between us...

27
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,630
What just happened

28
00:02:46,190 --> 00:02:47,080
was all an accident.

29
00:02:47,150 --> 00:02:48,000
Don't bring it up again.

30
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:55,560
Can you really predict the future

31
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,190
and help me ascend the throne?

32
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,430
(I really can predict the future,)

33
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,750
(but helping you ascend the throne
would be entirely unnecessary.)

34
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,680
(It would only be a needless effort.)

35
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,870
(I only)

36
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:04,680
(want to restore your memories.)

37
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,840
Of course.

38
00:03:06,190 --> 00:03:07,080
I know

39
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,680
that three days from now,
during the Hour of Chen,

40
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,080
you'll leave the city by imperial decree
to provide disaster relief.

41
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,360
But your officials

42
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,630
will overlook the village
hit hardest by the disaster.

43
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:15,560
Which one?

44
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,280
On the day you distribute the relief,

45
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,750
take me with you.

46
00:03:22,750 --> 00:03:23,560
I'll show you the way.

47
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,630
I'll be waiting.

48
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,750
Your Highness, if you're concerned
that a village might be overlooked,

49
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,960
I can have the officials
conduct another survey.

50
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,030
As for Miss He,

51
00:03:34,710 --> 00:03:35,870
we have no way of knowing
whether she's telling the truth.

52
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:37,430
In my opinion,

53
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,240
it would be better to...

54
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,400
(Why didn't I)

55
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:41,080
(feel repulsed just now?)

56
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,120
(I even wanted)

57
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:44,080
(to kiss her more deeply.)

58
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:53,430
Your Highness.

59
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,400
Your Highness.

60
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,430
You may leave.

61
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:04,840
Yes.

62
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:17,940
(Wenhua Hall)

63
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:19,920
Your Highness.

64
00:04:20,950 --> 00:04:21,600
Your Highness.

65
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,560
Your hand...

66
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:25,040
It's nothing.

67
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:26,600
Zhuguang.

68
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,390
You may leave.

69
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,560
I'd like to be alone for a while.

70
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,270
Yes.

71
00:04:43,270 --> 00:04:44,480
He Xiaoyuan.

72
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:47,830
Do you really care about him that much?

73
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,800
Your Highness.

74
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,310
It would be a shame

75
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:00,870
to waste such fine tribute wine.

76
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:12,430
Have you taken care of everything

77
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,870
regarding the attack on Zhao Boqing?

78
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:15,040
Rest assured.

79
00:05:15,510 --> 00:05:17,070
Even now, he still thinks

80
00:05:17,070 --> 00:05:18,750
I'm one of his most loyal men.

81
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:22,720
Well?

82
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,950
Don't I deserve some praise?

83
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:29,600
Keep a close watch on him
and the Crown Princess.

84
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,950
I picked up this wine.

85
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:38,950
If you want some,

86
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,390
you'll have to pay.

87
00:05:53,070 --> 00:05:55,000
But I really am curious.

88
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:58,070
Everyone says you care only
for the finer things

89
00:05:58,070 --> 00:05:59,000
and have no interest in politics.

90
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,680
How did you know what would happen

91
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:04,070
and recruit me six months
before the Seventh Prince

92
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,390
tried to bring me over to his side?

93
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,160
Because

94
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,680
I've died
by his sword thirty-three times.

95
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:13,800
In this lifetime,

96
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,800
it's my turn to wield the blade.

97
00:06:16,980 --> 00:06:19,100
(Thirty-fourth Lifetime, Imperial Prison)
You traitorous rebel.

98
00:06:19,430 --> 00:06:20,480
You plotted to seize the throne,

99
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,480
caused Father's death,

100
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,830
and even tried
to kill Princess Yun Fang and me.

101
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,360
And now,

102
00:06:27,870 --> 00:06:29,830
your own son is dead.

103
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,120
Don't tell me

104
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,950
you're hoping that I,

105
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:34,830
a powerless, deposed Crown Prince,

106
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,830
can somehow turn things around for you.

107
00:06:37,630 --> 00:06:39,070
You're right, Your Highness.

108
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,070
You are the heir to the throne,

109
00:06:42,870 --> 00:06:44,430
yet now you're utterly powerless.

110
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:44,920
You

111
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,240
can do nothing

112
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,830
and change nothing.

113
00:06:47,950 --> 00:06:48,920
Today,

114
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:51,120
I have indeed
come to turn things around,

115
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:52,600
and also

116
00:06:53,310 --> 00:06:54,830
to give you a gift,

117
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,160
so you can see for yourself

118
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,070
what your trusted Boqing

119
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:10,480
and the He Xiaoyuan you love so deeply

120
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:13,070
are truly like.

121
00:07:48,270 --> 00:07:49,600
(Even if it were a pig,)

122
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,680
I'd put it in the Crown Princess's seat.

123
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,390
I... I understand.

124
00:07:58,630 --> 00:07:59,430
What...

125
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:00,800
What is this?

126
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:03,830
These are the thirty-four cycles

127
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:06,560
I created with a secret art
under Zhao Boqing's coercion.

128
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:10,240
You were meant to be the Pleiades,
the sovereign star in the heavens,

129
00:08:10,390 --> 00:08:12,040
while he was merely the Kang star.

130
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:15,070
To steal the throne
that should have been yours,

131
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:17,190
he killed you time and again.

132
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:18,830
And He Xiaoyuan

133
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:21,360
was nothing more
than a pawn in his hands.

134
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,240
No.

135
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,360
That's impossible.

136
00:08:24,430 --> 00:08:25,240
Xiaoyuan...

137
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:27,430
Boqing...

138
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:29,800
Your Highness,

139
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:32,200
he is not the man you believe him to be,

140
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:36,360
a noble man who stepped
forward in a time of crisis

141
00:08:36,630 --> 00:08:38,080
and quelled the rebellion

142
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,670
when I launched my revolt.

143
00:08:39,670 --> 00:08:42,080
He is every bit
as deceitful and corrupt as I am.

144
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:48,240
He has deceived you
for thirty-four lifetimes.

145
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:52,600
Zhao Boqing.

146
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:53,680
He Xiaoyuan.

147
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,270
Fine.

148
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:58,240
Very well.

149
00:09:01,030 --> 00:09:01,720
And what about you?

150
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,910
Who gave you
the nerve to tell me all this?

151
00:09:05,150 --> 00:09:06,630
A man facing death

152
00:09:06,790 --> 00:09:08,870
no longer wishes
to help a tyrant do evil.

153
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:11,000
But more importantly,

154
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,480
I have a favor to ask.

155
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:15,870
I sacrificed years of my life

156
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:18,840
and spent thirty-four lifetimes
carrying out my plans,

157
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,510
only

158
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,480
to lose my son Fu Yang in the end.

159
00:09:21,750 --> 00:09:22,790
I cannot accept that.

160
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:24,510
I

161
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,120
am willing to sacrifice
the rest of my life

162
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,550
and all the cultivation I've gained

163
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:30,120
to begin another lifetime,

164
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:33,360
asking only that in the new cycle,

165
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,870
Your Highness
put my son Fu Yang to good use

166
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:37,360
and never let him again

167
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,550
pledge his loyalty to Zhao Boqing

168
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,390
only to meet a tragic end.

169
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:44,670
All right.

170
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,390
I promise you.

171
00:09:52,870 --> 00:09:54,200
I offer my life as a sacrifice

172
00:09:54,270 --> 00:09:55,360
to begin another lifetime.

173
00:09:55,750 --> 00:09:58,000
From this moment on, I shall never
enter the cycle of rebirth again.

174
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,360
In this lifetime,

175
00:09:59,670 --> 00:10:01,360
Your Highness
will have a favorable start.

176
00:10:01,670 --> 00:10:02,840
I only hope

177
00:10:05,390 --> 00:10:06,840
you make good use of it.

178
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:17,200
If the Crown Prince hadn't told it
with such sincerity and tears,

179
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:19,750
I really would've thought
it was some fantastical tale.

180
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,390
Like Zhuangzi dreaming
he was a butterfly.

181
00:10:25,870 --> 00:10:27,440
When I was first reborn,

182
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:30,480
I also couldn't tell
what was real and what was illusion.

183
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,670
Given another lifetime,

184
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,630
I investigated in secret

185
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:36,100
and discovered he was cultivating scholars
from humble backgrounds

186
00:10:36,100 --> 00:10:37,490
at a charity hall north of the city,

187
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,670
secretly exchanging letters
with people at the border,

188
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:41,630
and planting informants
throughout the palace.

189
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:43,030
Only then did I truly believe

190
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:45,470
that everything Zhixuan
told me was true.

191
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,830
Across thirty-four lifetimes,

192
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:50,070
Zhao Boqing killed me
thirty-three times.

193
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,910
He took you from Ruanhong Pavilion

194
00:10:53,910 --> 00:10:55,150
and made you his spy,

195
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:57,430
which further confirmed
what the Imperial Preceptor told me.

196
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,750
He knew the kind of woman I liked

197
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,990
was someone like you.

198
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:03,750
If he had no intention
of seizing the throne,

199
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,230
why would he go to such lengths?

200
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:09,350
So, Your Highness,

201
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,590
you like women like me?

202
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:16,350
I like well-bred, educated young ladies

203
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,390
of exceptional beauty

204
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:20,950
who excel in music, chess,
calligraphy, and painting.

205
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:23,270
Certainly not someone like you

206
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:26,350
who cares about nothing but money.

207
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,510
The well-bred part is all an act.

208
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:30,830
Making a living isn't easy.

209
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,870
In my line of work,

210
00:11:38,230 --> 00:11:39,620
as long as the price is right,

211
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,390
I can become

212
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,710
whatever the other person likes.

213
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:47,110
So the Imperial Preceptor
gave you a good start

214
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,470
by letting you keep your memories.

215
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,380
I awoke with

216
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,070
all my memories
from the thirty-fourth lifetime,

217
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,090
and I was reborn

218
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:56,790
several months before He Xiaoyuan.

219
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,030
Those few months

220
00:11:58,620 --> 00:12:00,590
were enough for me
to ask for He Xiaoyuan's hand,

221
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,030
make her the Crown Princess,

222
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,030
bring you over to my side first,

223
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:06,950
then send you to infiltrate his circle.

224
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,350
So you really do love He Xiaoyuan?

225
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:12,310
At least,

226
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,390
in the last lifetime,
when I had all my memories,

227
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:18,230
I did truly love her.

228
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:19,870
And

229
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:23,790
from what the Imperial Preceptor
showed me,

230
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,670
when she grew close to me,

231
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:26,990
it seemed

232
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,830
she had been forced into it.

233
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:33,510
Your Highness truly lives up
to your reputation

234
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:34,950
as a man deeply devoted to love.

235
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,670
But did you know

236
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,150
Zhao Boqing is about to

237
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:39,750
kill your future Crown Princess

238
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:42,150
and send me to your side instead?

239
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:44,950
What?

240
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:49,030
So the spy I sent out

241
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:51,190
is about to be sent right back to me?

242
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,150
Two lifetimes,

243
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:56,150
and Zhao Boqing
is still using the same tactic.

244
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,630
Unfortunately for him,

245
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:58,790
this time,

246
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:00,190
I have the advantage.

247
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,750
Then what outcome
would you like, Your Highness?

248
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,150
Arrange for assassins

249
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,750
to blend in
with the displaced people in Huaibei.

250
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,990
When Zhao Boqing is distributing relief,

251
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,990
have them seize
the chance to assassinate him.

252
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:19,470
Understood.

253
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,030
But Your Highness,

254
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:24,190
being a double agent is far too risky.

255
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,030
It'll cost you extra.

256
00:13:43,630 --> 00:13:44,670
Your Highness.

257
00:13:44,910 --> 00:13:47,030
For the sake of the Yu family's
years of loyalty to you,

258
00:13:47,270 --> 00:13:48,480
please save my father.

259
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:49,360
Those ledgers

260
00:13:49,510 --> 00:13:51,030
must have been fabricated to frame him.

261
00:13:52,150 --> 00:13:53,630
The Yu family embezzled grain shipments

262
00:13:53,870 --> 00:13:55,080
and withheld funds
meant for river works.

263
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:56,630
The evidence is conclusive.

264
00:13:57,870 --> 00:13:59,150
How could he have been framed?

265
00:13:59,910 --> 00:14:00,510
Your Highness,

266
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,550
the Yu family
has followed you for years.

267
00:14:02,630 --> 00:14:04,750
Even if we have no achievements,
we've certainly served you faithfully.

268
00:14:04,790 --> 00:14:06,600
Why have you suddenly
turned against my father...

269
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:08,200
Do you truly not know why?

270
00:14:08,790 --> 00:14:09,550
Your Highness.

271
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,440
Think carefully.

272
00:14:12,150 --> 00:14:13,960
What did you say to He Xiaoyuan?

273
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,080
What did you do to her?

274
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:16,390
Do you need me

275
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:18,510
to remind you of every last detail?

276
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,200
All because of her?

277
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,790
She's just a lowborn study companion.

278
00:14:24,270 --> 00:14:25,320
Only I,

279
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,480
the Yu family,

280
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:27,440
and my father

281
